      "title": "SpaceX Joins the Nasdaq-100 on July 7. Here Is What This Means for QQQ and QQQM Investors.",
      "summary": "SpaceX will be added to the Nasdaq-100 index on July 7, 2026, under new fast-track eligibility criteria for mega IPOs. This means QQQ and QQQM ETF investors will automatically own SpaceX shares. JPMorgan estimates $4.3 billion in buying pressure from index-tracking funds, which could create stock volatility. SpaceX will have approximately 1% weighting in the index due to limited free float market capitalization.",
